<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs $1.00/1.50 off - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs $1.00/1.50 off - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.50 lower than Tuesday's close. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3  230-260 lbs    57.50-59.00, few 59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  260-270 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>	  270-280 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows steady to 1.00 lower. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs    42.00-44.00</p>
<p>	 over 500 lbs    45.00-50.00</p>
</text>
